{"seq":13,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-08-saltmarsh-summary/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:40:22.396Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"8e015c8f11335fa5bd8ba17e2591db4a8cd84ea7e43d75fc0805cdc18e396e9d","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#coastal-team","text":"Sofia, here's what the channel history and Moss's Coastal notes show:\n\n1. Takeover: Moss's Oct 5, 2025 note says Saltmarsh Provisions changed hands on Monday, Oct 6, 2025. It doesn't name the new owner. The channel points to Bettina Kroll: on Oct 15, 2025 you called it \"Bettina's grocery account\", and on Nov 17 Bettina referred to it as \"Sofia's old grocery account\" and handled the Corinne issue herself. I'd write Bettina, from Oct 6, 2025, but nothing I can see states it outright, so please confirm with her.\n\n2. Discount: 10%. On Nov 17, 2025 Bettina first posted 12%, then corrected it to 10% (she had misread June Osei-Lark's draft worksheet).\n\n3. Corinne's admin access ticket: PD-4827, opened by Kwame on Oct 15, 2025. Don't confuse it with PD-4824, which is the reefer exception-report ticket.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
